// QNMF Ablation: No-P4 (Predictive Latent World Model Disabled)
// Base architecture with P1 State, P2 Memory, P3 Routing, P6 ECRA Controller
// Latent transition model P_theta and reward predictor R_theta disabled

network QNMFAblationP4 ⟦
    dense ⟬128⸴ 256⟭ ·
    relu ·
    dense ⟬256⸴ 2048⟭ ·
    relu ·
    dense ⟬2048⸴ 256⟭ ·
    relu ·
    dense ⟬256⸴ 128⟭ ·
⟧

process main⦅⦆ → int64 ⟦
    emit "QNMF_ABLATION_P4_NO_WORLDMODEL_INITIALIZED" ·
    yield 0 ·
⟧
